      "statement": "Login maps a 401 to \"Invalid email or password.\" and surfaces backend link failures through `?error=` on the login URL: ERROR_MESSAGES.invalid_token is \"This link is invalid or has expired.\" and ERROR_MESSAGES.token_expired directs the user to \"Forgot password?\" because that flow also verifies the email.",
