      "id": "claim_660cec4c0ca24be6b5e4007a83d11114",
      "statement": "Session persistence after login or a fragment-token redirect depends on the kit-stored bearer token: authGuard's checkSession() restores the user and teams on reload (short-circuiting with no HTTP when no token is stored), and scheduleRefresh silently renews via GET /token?renew at about 80% of the 15-minute token TTL.",
