      "id": "claim_70ceaf9b527b4b4fbd6a23e90578d27d",
      "statement": "OAuth sign-in is a plain browser navigation (not a fetch) to `{apiUrl}/auth/oauth/authorize/{provider}?noauthchallenge`, so the service skips its credential challenge and redirects through the provider back to the app with `#access_token=...`; a first-time OAuth user is given an account and a team automatically.",
